.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3 See who is missing required ability milestones so managers can prioritize the highest-leverage ability to address.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    Milestones is a Gruuv Health category (Healthy / Warning / Needs Attention), same rules as 1:1 Hub Overview.
    Required abilities come from the teammate’s current position and active assignments. No required abilities is vacuously Healthy.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 How to read each row
  %ul.mb-3
    %li Status icon is the person’s Milestones rollup.
    %li Counts show Healthy / Warning / Needs Attention required abilities.
    %li
      The attention column shows
      %strong one
      non-healthy ability, chosen by: most required assignments → highest required milestone → Needs Attention before Warning → name.
    %li Refresh queues a Gruuv Health recalculation when data looks stale.

  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 Status legend
  %ul.list-unstyled.mb-0
    %li.mb-1
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2.bg-success{style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Healthy — required milestone earned, or an active goal is attached
    %li.mb-1
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2.bg-warning{style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Warning — earlier milestone only, or only a draft goal attached
    %li.mb-0
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2.bg-danger{style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Needs Attention — no milestone and no goal on a required ability
